{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this PVE third person extraction shooter, you will embark on contracts in a galaxy at war where the money you earn can be used to purchase upgrades like weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose which contracts you want to complete.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a galaxy at war, Choose contracts whichever factions you choose. There are many different mission types which will range from defending points from invaders to hunting down dangerous enemies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">High Stakes Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat will be deadly and punishing and every bolt that is shot at you can be your last. Make smart tactical decisions or risk being caught by dangerous enemies and gunned down where you stand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get the right tools for the job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase upgrades that will help you to complete your jobs more efficiently. Items in the shop range from High powered weaponry to protective armor, as well as various utility items such as jetpacks, mines, and even hirable crew members to assist you on jobs.\u00a0\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803670?t=1751339493","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803670?t=1751339493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/4c09ae754a80adc78414cc2f63547817070c854b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751339493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/4c09ae754a80adc78414cc2f63547817070c854b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751339493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"descrip